{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"扭箭头范畴"},2],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"slug":[{"Plain":"扭箭头范畴"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 的<strong>扭箭头范畴</strong> (twisted arrow category) $\\mathsf{TwArr}(\\mathcal C)$ 是其 Hom 函子 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,-)\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Ani}$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"元素范畴","text":"元素范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>具体地, $\\mathsf{TwArr}(\\mathcal C)$ 的对象为箭头 $f\\colon X\\to Y$, 态射为如下交换图.\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{ccc}\r\nX_1 &amp; \\overset{f}{\\rightarrow} &amp; Y_1 \\\\\r\n\\uparrow &amp;  &amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\nX_2 &amp; \\underset{g}{\\rightarrow} &amp; Y_2\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n<p>注意文献中这个概念有时会相差一个反范畴.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>对于两个函子 $F_1,F_2,\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$,\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n&amp;\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)}(F_1,F_2)\\\\\r\n\\simeq\\operatorname{lim}_{(X\\to Y)\\in\\mathsf{TwArr}(\\mathcal C)}&amp;\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F_1(X),F_2(Y)).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}